

--[[
    STORAGE HUNTERS | AUTO FISHING V17

    CHANGES:
    - CHASE fish aggressively when outside zone
    - FOLLOW fish with smaller corrections when inside
    - Reset tracking between every catch
    - Reacquire fishing GUI continuously
    - No timed fallback during real GUI tracking
    - Detect broken fishing rods
    - Attempt automatic replacement
    - Verify replacement before casting
    - Preserve long-distance casting
    - Continue fishing after failed catches
    - Clean up previous script versions
]]

